<h2 id="frequently-asked-questions" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<h3 id="why-is-youbot-crawling-my-site" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">Why is YouBot crawling my site?</h3>
<p>YouBot crawls publicly accessible web pages to provide comprehensive, real-time search results for You.com users. If your content is public and not blocked by robots.txt, it may be crawled and indexed.</p>
<h3 id="how-often-does-youbot-crawl-my-site" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">How often does YouBot crawl my site?</h3>
<p>Crawl frequency depends on factors like:</p>
<ul class="[&amp;&gt;li]:relative [&amp;&gt;li]:before:text-(color:--grayscale-a10) mb-3 list-none pl-3 [&amp;&gt;li]:pl-3 [&amp;&gt;li]:before:absolute [&amp;&gt;li]:before:ml-[-22px] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:mt-[-1px] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:content-[&#x27;⦁&#x27;] [&amp;&gt;li]:before:self-center">
<li class="">How often your content changes</li>
<li class="">Your site’s popularity and authority</li>
<li class="">Your server’s response time</li>
<li class="">Any crawl-delay directives in robots.txt</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="can-i-request-a-recrawl-of-my-content" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">Can I request a recrawl of my content?</h3>
<p>For immediate indexing needs or custom crawl requests, please reach out to <a class="fern-mdx-link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="mailto:spider@you.com">spider@you.com<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link external-link-icon"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a>.</p>
<h3 id="does-youbot-respect-robotstxt" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">Does YouBot respect robots.txt?</h3>
<p>Yes, YouBot fully respects robots.txt directives, including user-agent specific rules and crawl-delay settings.</p>
<h3 id="how-do-i-report-a-problem-with-youbot" class="max-md:pr-4" data-state="closed" data-fern-style="cursor:pointer">How do I report a problem with YouBot?</h3>
